  83+ 3CE1              ; Physical overlay-page allocator.
  84+ 3CE1              ; Pool: physical pages 07h..0Fh. Pages 04h/05h/06h are pinned to X86IO/X86ALU/X86DEV;
  85+ 3CE1              ; pages 00h..03h are never allocator-owned. WIN3 is not used here.
  86+ 3CE1              ;
  87+ 3CE1              ; p126_overlay_allocate_page:
  88+ 3CE1              ;   OUT A=physical page 07h..0Fh, carry clear; A=0/carry set if exhausted.
  89+ 3CE1              ;   Clobbers BC, IX.
  90+ 3CE1              ;
  91+ 3CE1              ; p126_overlay_release_page:
  92+ 3CE1              ;   IN A=physical page. Carry clear on release; carry set with A=status on
  93+ 3CE1              ;   invalid, already-free, currently mapped, or actively executing page.
  94+ 3CE1              ;   Clobbers BC, DE, HL, IX.
